{"pages": {"1": [{"bbox": [390.0, 377.0, 854.0, 554.0], "text": "# Convocation for Conferring Degrees"}, {"bbox": [391.0, 609.0, 767.0, 677.0], "text": "Faculty of Engineering Class of 2026"}, {"bbox": [392.0, 699.0, 693.0, 724.0], "text": "Tuesday, June 16, 9:00am"}], "2": [{"bbox": [87.0, 87.0, 533.0, 119.0], "text": "## Land Acknowledgement"}, {"bbox": [85.0, 129.0, 722.0, 182.0], "text": "McMaster University recognizes and acknowledges that we meet today on the traditional territories of the Mississauga and Haudenosaunee nations within the lands protected by the Dish With One Spoon wampum agreement."}, {"bbox": [88.0, 253.0, 261.0, 286.0], "text": "## Presiding"}, {"bbox": [86.0, 312.0, 412.0, 349.0], "text": "Chancellor Nicholas Brathwaite, BA (Hons), BA, MA"}, {"bbox": [86.0, 381.0, 375.0, 435.0], "text": "President and Vice-Chancellor Dr. Susan Tighe, PhD, PEng FCAE, FCSCE, FEIC, C.Dir"}, {"bbox": [85.0, 689.0, 397.0, 758.0], "text": "Visit registrar.mcmaster.ca/ convocation-2026 to learn more about the Honorary Degree recipients, award winners and valedictorians."}, {"bbox": [554.0, 252.0, 882.0, 283.0], "text": "## Order of Exercises"}, {"bbox": [554.0, 310.0, 788.0, 375.0], "text": "The Graduand Procession\n\nThe Academic Procession\n\nThe Chancellor's Procession"}, {"bbox": [554.0, 381.0, 708.0, 424.0], "text": "Opening Remarks"}, {"bbox": [552.0, 428.0, 852.0, 494.0], "text": "The Conferring of Honorary Degrees\n\nThe Convocation Address"}, {"bbox": [553.0, 500.0, 857.0, 564.0], "text": "The Conferring of Degrees In-Course\n\nThe Presentation of the Graduates"}, {"bbox": [554.0, 571.0, 757.0, 613.0], "text": "The Valedictory Address"}, {"bbox": [554.0, 621.0, 828.0, 706.0], "text": "Awards of the 2025-2026 Session\n\nPresident's Address\n\nClosing Remarks"}, {"bbox": [554.0, 712.0, 731.0, 754.0], "text": "The National Anthem"}, {"bbox": [86.0, 874.0, 841.0, 925.0], "text": "The McMaster University convocation program is a listing of degree candidates who